{"t": 17.923, "n": 24, "ev": "result", "ok": true, "text": "Both rows of phase 5 are built and marked ✓ 2026-11-26 in the plan. I ran no tests, because neither row names a test file.\n\n- **5.1:** I added a `usage_limit` escalation row to the \"Questions, events and breakpoints\" table in `running-workflows.guide.md`. It names the reset instant `usage_limit_resets_at`, also in the status row. It says nothing was spent or judged. It gives the resume with no `--decision`, which reruns only the session the limit ended. I changed the \"Don't `proceed` after an infrastructure failure\" sentence only by adding that the same holds for `proceed` at this pause.\n- **5.2:** In `pauses.md` I added the usage-limit pause to the list of common kinds, with the reset instant read from `payload.usage_limit_resets_at`. I added a paragraph after the decisions list. It says to answer this pause with `tempergraph resume <workflow> <thread> --relayed` and no decision word, and that no decision word is recommended.\n\nI did not run the step-7 check of specs outside the plan's front matter, because both files are docs.\n\nARTIFACT phase_note: Built rows 5.1 and 5.2 (guide table row and sentence tweak in running-workflows.guide.md; usage-limit kind and plain-resume paragraph in skills/run/references/pauses.md) and marked both in the plan. No test file ran: no row of this phase names one. Deviations: none.", "subtype": "success", "is_error": false, "session_id": "14d87222-5c0e-4f65-af5f-dd1ad2b3aa13"}
